ys to move FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_3: \"Never mix Fire & Water!\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_4: \"Green goo kills them both\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_5: \"Levers remain as you left them\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_6: \"Pushers however must be held\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_7: \"You can move boxes\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_8: \"Don't forget to grab all diamonds!\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_9: \"Open the finish doors by standing on them\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1_1: \"Use the buttons to move WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2_1: \"Tap the blue arrow to control FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_3_1: \"While pressing one button, press the other one to jump\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1_2: \"Tap the left buttons to move WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2_2: \"Use the right buttons to move FireBoy\"\n\t\t}\n\t})\n}\n.call(this),\nfunction() {\n\tdefine(\"utils/lang/langs/es\", [\"require\"], function(a) {\n\t\treturn {\n\t\t\tplay: \"Jugar\",\n\t\t\tmore_games: \"Mas juegos\",\n\t\t\twalkthrough: \"Ver video\",\n\t\t\tok: \"Ok\",\n\t\t\tcontinue: \"continuar\",\n\t\t\tcredits_to: \"Creditos\",\n\t\t\tback: \"Atras\",\n\t\t\tlevel_numbers: \"numerar niveles\",\n\t\t\tpaused: \"Pausa\",\n\t\t\tend: \"Salir\",\n\t\t\tretry: \"Reintentar\",\n\t\t\trevive: \"Revivir\",\n\t\t\tresume: \"Seguir\",\n\t\t\tmenu: \"menu\",\n\t\t\tgame_over: \"Game Over\",\n\t\t\tcongratulations: \"Felicidades!\",\n\t\t\tyou_completed: \"Has completado el juego\",\n\t\t\tcancel: \"Cancelar\",\n\t\t\tthis: \"Este\",\n\t\t\tlevel: \"nivel\",\n\t\t\tnot_yet: \"no esta disponible aun\",\n\t\t\tcomplete_more: \"Completa mas niveles\",\n\t\t\tto_unlock: \"para desbloquear\",\n\t\t\twing_lock_header: \"Este es un nivel sepecial\",\n\t\t\twing_lock_desc: \"Completa todos los niveles de esta ala para desbloquearlo\",\n\t\t\tok_1: \"Ok !\",\n\t\t\tunlock_all: \"Debloquear todos !\",\n\t\t\twelcome: \"Bienvenido!\",\n\t\t\tfirst_time_question: \"¿Es la primera vez que juegas a Fireboy & Watergirl?\",\n\t\t\tskip: \"Saltar\",\n\t\t\ttutorial: \"Tutorial\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_1: \"Puedes arrastrar las hadas para ayudar a Fireboy & Watergirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_2: \"Las hadas tambien pueden ayudaros con las palancas\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_5: \"A veces necesitas la hada del color correcto\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_6: \"Pero las hadas blancas pueden activar cualquier color\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_7: \"Buena suerte!\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1: \"Usa A,W,D para mover a WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2: \"Usa las flechas para mover a FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_3: \"Nunca mezcles agua con fuego !\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_4: \"El liquido verde los mata a los dos\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_5: \"Las palancas se quedan como las dejas\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_6: \"Los pulsadores hay que aguantarlos\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_7: \"Puedes mover cajas\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_8: \"No te olvides de cojer todos los diamantes!\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_9: \"Poneros delante de las puertas para abrirlas\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1_1: \"Usa los botones para mover a WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2_1: \"Dale a la flecha azul para controlar a FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_3_1: \"Mientras pulsas un boton, dale al otro para saltar\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1_2: \"Usa los botones de la izquierda para mover a WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2_2: \"Usa los botones de la derecha para mover a FireBoy\"\n\t\t}\n\t})\n}\n.call(this),\nfunction() {\n\tdefine(\"utils/lang/langs/fr\", [\"require\"], function(a) {\n\t\treturn {\n\t\t\tplay: \"Jouer\",\n\t\t\tmore_games: \"Plus de jeux\",\n\t\t\twalkthrough: \"Présentation\",\n\t\t\tok: \"Ok\",\n\t\t\tcontinue: \"Continuer\",\n\t\t\tcredits_to: \"Tous les crédits vont à\",\n\t\t\tback: \"Retour\",\n\t\t\tlevel_numbers: \"Nombre de niveaux\",\n\t\t\tpaused: \"En pause\",\n\t\t\tend: \"Fin\",\n\t\t\tretry: \"Réessayer\",\n\t\t\trevive: \"Rétablir\",\n\t\t\tresume: \"Reprendre\",\n\t\t\tmenu: \"Menu\",\n\t\t\tgame_over: \"Game Over\",\n\t\t\tcongratulations: \"Félicitations !\",\n\t\t\tyou_completed: \"Vous avez terminé le jeu\",\n\t\t\tcancel: \"Annuler\",\n\t\t\tthis: \"Ce\",\n\t\t\tlevel: \"niveau\",\n\t\t\tnot_yet: \"n'est pas encore disponible\",\n\t\t\tcomplete_more: \"Terminez plus de niveaux\",\n\t\t\tto_unlock: \"Pour débloquer\",\n\t\t\twing_lock_header: \"Ceci est un niveau spécial\",\n\t\t\twing_lock_desc: \"Finissez tous les niveaux de cette aile pour débloquer\",\n\t\t\tok_1: \"Ok !\",\n\t\t\tunlock_all: \"Déverrouillez tous les niveaux !\",\n\t\t\twelcome: \"Bienvenue !\",\n\t\t\tfirst_time_question: \"Première fois que vous jouez à\\nFireboy & Watergirl ?\",\n\t\t\tskip: \"Passer\",\n\t\t\ttutorial: \"Tutoriel\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_1: \"Vous pouvez faire glisser les fées pour aider Fireboy & Watergirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_2: \"Les fées peuvent vous aider avec les leviers\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_4: \"\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_5: \"Parfois, vous avez besoin d'une fée de la bonne couleur\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_6: \"Mais les fées blanches peuvent activer toutes les couleurs\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_7: \"Bonne chance !\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1: \"Utilisez A,W,D pour faire bouger WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2: \"Utilisez les touches directionnelles pour faire bouger FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_3: \"Ne mélangez jamais l'Eau & le Feu !\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_4: \"Le gelée verte les tuera tous les deux\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_5: \"Les leviers resteront comme vous les avez laissés\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_6: \"Au contraire, il faudra maintenir les boutons\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_7: \"Vous pouvez faire bouger les boîtes\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_8: \"N'oubliez pas d'attraper tous les diamants !\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_9: \"Ouvrez les portes d'arrivée en vous plaçant dessus\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1_1: \"Utilisez les boutons pour déplacer WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2_1: \"Cliquez sur la flèche bleue pour contrôler FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_3_1: \"Pendant que vous appuyez sur un bouton, appuyez sur l'autre pour sauter\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2_2: \"Utilisez les boutons de droite pour faire bouger FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1_2: \"Utilisez les boutons de gauche pour faire bouger WaterGirl\"\n\t\t}\n\t})\n}\n.call(this),\nfunction() {\n\tdefine(\"utils/lang/langs/it\", [\"require\"], function(a) {\n\t\treturn {\n\t\t\tplay: \"Gioca\",\n\t\t\tmore_games: \"Più giochi\",\n\t\t\twalkthrough: \"Presentazione\",\n\t\t\tok: \"Ok\",\n\t\t\tcontinue: \"Continua\",\n\t\t\tcredits_to: \"Tutto il merito va a\",\n\t\t\tback: \"Indietro\",\n\t\t\tlevel_numbers: \"Numeri del livello\",\n\t\t\tpaused: \"PAUSA\",\n\t\t\tend: \"Fine\",\n\t\t\tretry: \"Riprova\",\n\t\t\trevive: \"Ripristina\",\n\t\t\tresume: \"Continua\",\n\t\t\tmenu: \"MENU\",\n\t\t\tgame_over: \"Game Over\",\n\t\t\tcongratulations: \"Congratulazioni!\",\n\t\t\tyou_completed: \"Hai completato il gioco\",\n\t\t\tcancel: \"Annulla\",\n\t\t\tthis: \"Questo\",\n\t\t\tlevel: \"livello\",\n\t\t\tnot_yet: \"non è ancora disponibile\",\n\t\t\tcomplete_more: \"Completa più livelli\",\n\t\t\tto_unlock: \"per sbloccare\",\n\t\t\twing_lock_header: \"questo è un livello speciale\",\n\t\t\twing_lock_desc: \"completa tutti i livelli di quest'ala per sbloccare\",\n\t\t\tok_1: \"Ok!\",\n\t\t\tunlock_all: \"Sblocca tutti i livelli!\",\n\t\t\twelcome: \"Benvenuto!\",\n\t\t\tfirst_time_question: \"È la prima volta che giochi a\\nFireboy & Watergirl?\",\n\t\t\tskip: \"Salta\",\n\t\t\ttutorial: \"tutorial\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_1: \"Puoi trascinare le fate per aiutare Fireboy & Watergirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_2: \"Le fate possono aiutarti con le leve\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_4: \"\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_5: \"A volte hai bisogno di una fata del colore giusto\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_6: \"Ma le fate bianche possono attivare qualsiasi colore\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_7: \"Buona fortuna!\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_1: \"Usa A,W,D per muovere WaterGirl\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_2: \"Usa i tasti freccia per muovere FireBoy\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_3: \"Mai mischiare Fuoco e Acqua\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_4: \"La poltiglia verde gli uccide entrambi\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_5: \"Le leve rimangono come le hai lasciate\",\n\t\t\ttutorial_0_6: \"I pulsanti invece devono 